## 10. ERROR HANDLING & RECOVERY

### 10.1 Recovery Strategies

```
STRATEGY 1: CONDITIONAL EXECUTION
  ├─ COND skips failed steps
  ├─ Prevents cascading failures
  ├─ Each step validates input
  └─ Alternative processing paths

STRATEGY 2: RESTART CAPABILITY
  ├─ RESTART=STEPNAME in JOB
  ├─ Resume from failure point
  ├─ Skip successful steps
  └─ Saves processing time

STRATEGY 3: RESTART PARAMETERS
  ├─ Hold job in queue initially
  ├─ Investigate failure
  ├─ Correct root cause
  ├─ Resubmit from restart point
  └─ Useful for long-running jobs

STRATEGY 4: ERROR NOTIFICATION
  ├─ Send alert to operator
  ├─ Email to support team
  ├─ Log critical events
  └─ Enable rapid response
```

### 10.2 Restart Example

```jcl
//*==================================================
//* JOB WITH RESTART CAPABILITY
//*==================================================

//BIGPROC JOB (7000,PROJECT),'LARGE PROCESS',
//            CLASS=A,
//            TIME=(2,0),
//            REGION=64M,
//            RESTART=STEP3
  └─ If job fails: Can restart from STEP3
  └─ STEP1 & STEP2 skipped
  └─ Only re-run STEP3 onward

//*─────────────────────────────────────────────
//* STEP 1: EXTRACT LARGE FILE (30 min)
//*─────────────────────────────────────────────
//STEP1 EXEC PGM=EXTRACT-BIG-FILE
//SYSOUT DD SYSOUT=*
//OUTPUT DD DSN=&&EXTRACTED,
//           DISP=(NEW,PASS),
//           SPACE=(CYL,(5000,2500))

//*─────────────────────────────────────────────
//* STEP 2: SORT FILE (20 min)
//*─────────────────────────────────────────────
//STEP2 EXEC PGM=SORT,COND=(0,NE,STEP1)
//SORTIN DD DSN=&&EXTRACTED,DISP=(OLD,PASS)
//SORTOUT DD DSN=&&SORTED,
//            DISP=(NEW,PASS),
//            SPACE=(CYL,(5200,2600))
//SYSIN DD *
  SORT FIELDS=(1,10,CH,A)
/*

//*─────────────────────────────────────────────
//* STEP 3: COMPLEX PROCESSING (Variable time)
//*─────────────────────────────────────────────
//STEP3 EXEC PGM=COMPLEX-PROCESS,
//            REGION=64M,
//            COND=(0,NE,STEP2)
//SYSOUT DD SYSOUT=*
//INPUT DD DSN=&&SORTED,DISP=(OLD,PASS)
//OUTPUT DD DSN=&&PROCESSED,
//           DISP=(NEW,PASS),
//           SPACE=(CYL,(5000,2500))

//*─────────────────────────────────────────────
//* STEP 4: GENERATE REPORTS
//*─────────────────────────────────────────────
//STEP4 EXEC PGM=GENERATE-REPORTS,
//            COND=(0,NE,STEP3)
//SYSOUT DD SYSOUT=*
//INPUT DD DSN=&&PROCESSED,DISP=(OLD,PASS)
//OUTPUT DD SYSOUT=*

//

If STEP3 fails:
├─ Hold job (investigate)
├─ Fix issue
├─ Resubmit with RESTART=STEP3
├─ STEP1 & STEP2 skipped
└─ Only STEP3 & STEP4 re-executed
```

