## 12. BEST PRACTICES

```
1. NAMING CONVENTIONS
  ├─ Use meaningful hierarchical names
  ├─ COMPANY.APP.TYPE.VERSION format
  ├─ Keep consistent across organization
  └─ Document naming standards

2. COMMENTS & DOCUMENTATION
  ├─ //* for line comments
  ├─ Explain complex logic
  ├─ Document parameters
  ├─ Date changes
  └─ Include author information

3. RESOURCE ALLOCATION
  ├─ REGION: Adequate but not excessive
  ├─ TIME: Realistic limits
  ├─ SPACE: Account for growth
  └─ Monitor and adjust

4. ERROR HANDLING
  ├─ Use COND wisely
  ├─ Don't skip validation
  ├─ Capture errors early
  └─ Notify on failures

5. TEMPORARY DATA SETS
  ├─ Use && prefix
  ├─ Delete after use
  ├─ DISP=(NEW,DELETE) for cleanup
  └─ Pass between steps with PASS

6. PROCEDURE REUSE
  ├─ Create standard procedures
  ├─ Parameterize where possible
  ├─ One procedure = One function
  └─ Maintain centrally

7. TESTING
  ├─ TYPRUN=SCAN to check syntax
  ├─ Test with small datasets first
  ├─ Verify output before production
  └─ Keep test data available

8. MONITORING & LOGS
  ├─ Capture SYSOUT for analysis
  ├─ MSGLEVEL=(1,1) for detail
  ├─ Archive important logs
  └─ Review for issues
```

