### Example 1: Daily Banking End-of-Day Processing

**Business Requirement:**

```
Daily Process:
├─ Consolidate all transactions
├─ Calculate account balances
├─ Generate statements
├─ Reconcile with partner banks
├─ Create audit reports
└─ Back up critical data

Timeline:
├─ 6:00 PM - Accept real-time transactions
├─ 6:30 PM - Start batch processing
├─ 8:00 PM - Transactions posted
├─ 8:30 PM - Statements generated
├─ 9:00 PM - Reports completed
└─ 9:30 PM - Backup finished
