## Data Processing Workflows

### Theory: ETL (Extract, Transform, Load)

**Typical ETL Pattern:**

```
EXTRACT ──→ TRANSFORM ──→ LOAD ──→ VERIFY
  ↓            ↓           ↓         ↓
 Read        Process     Write    Reconcile
 Data        Data        Data     & Report

JCL orchestrates all steps
```

