**JCL Optimization:**

```jcl
//*==================================================
//* OPTIMIZED JCL - HIGH PERFORMANCE
//*==================================================

//OPTIMIZED JOB (10000,PERF),'OPTIMIZED JOB',
//              CLASS=A,
//              TIME=(0,60),
//              REGION=64M

//* Key optimizations:
//* 1. Adequate REGION (64M for large dataset)
//* 2. Realistic TIME (60 seconds)
//* 3. High priority CLASS (A)
//* 4. Large block size (12000)
//* 5. Multiple extents for growth
//* 6. RLSE to free unused space

//STEP1    EXEC PGM=EFFICIENT-PROGRAM,
//              REGION=64M

//SYSOUT   DD SYSOUT=*

//* Optimized input - large block size
//INPUT    DD DSN=COMPANY.DATA.LARGE,
//             DISP=SHR,
//             BUFNO=8

//* Optimized output - pre-allocated space
//OUTPUT   DD DSN=COMPANY.RESULTS,
//             DISP=(NEW,CATLG),
//             UNIT=3390,
//             SPACE=(CYL,(1000,500),RLSE),
//             RECFM=FB,
//             LRECL=256,
//             BLKSIZE=12160

//* Sorted input benefits program
//SORTED   DD DSN=COMPANY.SORTED.DATA,
//             DISP=SHR,
//             BUFNO=8

//PARM     DD *
  OPTIMIZE=SPEED BUFFER=LARGE THREADS=4
/*

Performance Metrics:
────────────────────

Before Optimization:
├─ CPU Time: 120 seconds
├─ Elapsed Time: 300 seconds (queuing)
├─ REGION: 8M (marginal)
├─ BLKSIZE: 2560 (small)
└─ Total Cost: High

After Optimization:
├─ CPU Time: 45 seconds (-62%)
├─ Elapsed Time: 120 seconds (-60%)
├─ REGION: 64M (sufficient)
├─ BLKSIZE: 12160 (optimal)
└─ Total Cost: Lower
